Z||000017||Fiero5||06-07-2001||09:34 AM||||Coolblue87GT wrote: "What's the Fiero 9 , thought U went by Fiero 5?"<P>Fiero9 is the plate number of that car. When I first registered on Pennocks, I was taking my Fiero5 to alot of shows, so I just used that. Seemed logical at the time.<BR>I have thought of changing my ID name now that we have 12 plus and counting, and I don't use just one of them all the time. Last week for example, I took Fiero1 to work two days in a row. Then the rest of the week I took Fiero9, etc. It all depends on how the weather is, if I need to work on one of them want to use the auto shop here at school, and so on.<P>Anyone have any ideas of what I could switch my name to now? I kinda liked toomanyFieros, but I think that is allready used.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Glowing_Fiero9_sig.jpg">                            <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||7
